              "name": "Chey1"
            },
            "reviewBody": "yummmm",
            "datePublished": "2011-11-01T19:44:34.137Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Melissa Goff"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I saw this today and thought since I had the ingredients on hand. I'd throw this together. While I thought it was okay and nice flavor. I only questioned whether or not I should have drained the Rotel. Which I didn't leaving it with juice made it very soupy like but had a nice flavor. I took the suggestion of Sarah Jo and added Taco seasoning. So the next time I might 4oz of Cream cheese to thicken it up some.",
            "datePublished": "2011-10-21T16:25:17.290Z"
          }
